Package: DisCO.VG
Title: DisCO-VG links disease-associated variants to their target genes
    with cell-type/tissue specificity
Version: 0.0.0.9700
Authors@R: 
    person("Elysia", "Chou", , "elysian@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1007-4455"))
Description: DisCO-VG links disease-associated variants to their target
    genes by scoring them based on a variety of data sources. By using
    cell-type-/tissue-specific data, one can further refine their DisCO-VG
    scores for their disease/trait of interest.
